---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import StoreButtons from '../../components/StoreButtons.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="The story behind PackLight: making trip planning as light as the urge to leave."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        PackLight was born from a simple observation: planning a trip should be the
        exciting part, not the chore. Between dozens of open tabs, contradictory blogs
        and hours spent comparing, the urge to leave often burns out before departure.
      </p>
      <p>
        The app turns an urge — a destination, some dates, a style — into a complete,
        day-by-day itinerary, with the links to book flights, stays and transfers, and
        the packing list that goes with it. In 30 seconds.
      </p>

      <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
      <img
        class="about-portrait"
        src="/assets/maxime.webp"
        alt="Portrait of Maxime Ducher, founder of PackLight"
        width="1200"
        height="1200"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <p>
        PackLight is built by Maxime Ducher, a journalist for five years in Paris
        newsrooms, then a year in Australia on a working holiday visa. The app grew out
        of his own trips: Indonesia, Australia, Europe. A solo, human-scale project with
        one obsession: that every feature actually serves the departure.
      </p>

      <h2>Our promise</h2>
      <p>
        Leaving should be as simple as wanting to. That's the only compass behind every
        product decision.
      </p>

      <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <StoreButtons medium="about" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-portrait {
    display: block;
    width: 220px;
    max-width: 60%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .about-portrait {
      float: right;
      margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
